graph TB
    subgraph IPP["llm-d-inference-payload-processor (single binary, controller-runtime manager host)"]
        Runner["payload-processor runner<br/>cmd/ + cmd/runner/"]
        ExtProc["ext-proc gRPC server<br/>envoy.service.ext_proc.v3<br/>9004/TCP, self-signed TLS"]
        Health["gRPC health server<br/>9005/TCP plaintext<br/>always SERVING"]
        Metrics["Metrics / pprof server<br/>9090/TCP plain HTTP<br/>optional TokenReview/SAR filter"]
        Framework["Plugin framework<br/>registry, profiles, ModelSelector<br/>Filter → Score → Pick"]
        Reconciler["ConfigMapReconciler<br/>base-model-to-header plugin"]
        Datalayer["Datalayer + in-memory datastore<br/>request metadata, cost, models.json"]

        Runner -->|starts, no leader election| ExtProc
        Runner -->|starts| Health
        Runner -->|starts| Metrics
        Runner -->|loads plugins| Framework
        ExtProc -->|buffers body to EndOfStream, runs pipeline| Framework
        Framework -->|adapter → base-model lookup| Reconciler
        Framework -->|scorer inputs| Datalayer
    end

    Config["PayloadProcessorConfig<br/>llm-d.ai/v1alpha1<br/>YAML file, not a CRD"]
    ConfigMaps["ConfigMaps labelled<br/>inference.llm-d.ai/ipp-managed=true"]
    ModelsJson["models.json<br/>model / pricing config<br/>fsnotify watched"]

    Config -->|--config-file / --config-text, read at startup| Runner
    ConfigMaps -->|watched by| Reconciler
    ModelsJson -->|watched by| Datalayer

    Gateway["Inference Gateway<br/>Istio / Envoy / GKE"] -->|ext_proc stream gRPC/9004| ExtProc
    ExtProc -->|header mutations<br/>X-Gateway-Model-Name<br/>X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name| Gateway
    Gateway -->|header-based route| Pools["InferencePools / llm-d-router EPP"]

    Chart["Helm chart payload-processor<br/>Deployment, Service, ConfigMap, RBAC"] -->|istio| IstioRes["EnvoyFilter + DestinationRule"]
    Chart -->|gke| GKERes["GCPRoutingExtension + HealthCheckPolicy"]
    IstioRes -.->|inserts ext_proc filter| Gateway

    Reconciler -->|get/list/watch configmaps| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    Downstream["ai-gateway-payload-processing<br/>RHOAI MaaS AI Gateway"] -.->|Go library + Helm subchart| Runner

